  "description": "REWPOA crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C78 H84 Gd6 N18 O37 1-,C6 H16 N1 1+,7(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd3 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd4 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd5 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd6 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.918-4.187 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.37-120.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd6(L6-2H)6(O)(CH3COO)6](HNEt3)(H2O)8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
